          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot, if a model in this unit lost a wound as a result of those attacks, this unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6+2&quot;.</characteristic>
