      <profiles>
        <profile id="349b-c3a7-df5e-cc96" name="Take Wing" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your opponent&apos;s Fight phase, if this unit is **unengaged**, you can place this unit in **strategic reserves**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="60ec-7f81-e84d-d3d8" name="Neutronium Cascade Mine (Once per battle, per unit)" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of any phase, you can select one enemy unit within 3&quot; of this unit and roll one D6. On a 2+:
■ That enemy unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.
■ Or: If that enemy unit is a **^^Vehicle^^**/**^^Monster^^** unit, that enemy unit suffers 2D3 **mortal wounds**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="fe0c-1248-f34a-2795" name="Strike from the Skies" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, if this unit made an **ingress move** this turn, this unit&apos;s ranged attacks can re-roll **hit rolls**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
